@startuml
title Update Task - Main Success Scenario

actor "Generic User" as User
participant Browser
participant Server
database "Persistence Model" as Persistence

User -> Browser : Click "updateTask" icon on a table row
Browser -> Server : Request task by id
Server -> Persistence : Retrieve task data by id
Persistence --> Server : Return task data
Server --> Browser : Respond with formView (fields pre-populated)
Browser --> User : Display pre-filled form

User -> Browser : Modify field(s)
User -> Browser : Click "save" (submit)
Browser -> Server : Submit updated task data

Server -> Persistence : Update existing record
Persistence --> Server : Confirm update
Server -> Server : Render TaskView with modified task
Server --> Browser : Respond with TaskView
Browser --> User : Display modified task (only this task)

@enduml